Nexora v10

Intelligence. Secured.

Nexora is a local-first AI assistant built in Python without requiring an external language model. It combines deterministic reasoning, memory, knowledge retrieval, conversation context, intent detection, calculation, safety checks, and security controls.

Features
🧠 Local reasoning engine
💾 Persistent memory
📚 User-controlled knowledge base
💬 Conversation context
🎯 Intent detection
🧮 Safe mathematical calculator
🎭 Multiple personality modes
🔐 API-key authentication
🛡️ Security monitoring
🚦 Rate limiting
🔒 Secret detection
🧯 Fail-closed error handling
🌐 Browser-based interface
❤️ Health endpoint
🚫 No arbitrary Python execution
🚫 No shell-command execution
🚫 No external AI model required by default

